[{"answer":"Good workout, Cindy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/1.mp3"},{"answer":"You're going to be in good shape for the intramurals next month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. Whoo! If you don't kill me first.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Wah! Whoosh.... ohh.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/4.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, I get the hint. You can call it a day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Just be back here tomorrow at the same time, eh?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll be here, but... can I talk to you a minute about something, Coach?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure. What is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Coach, I'm not, uh, I'm not doing so good in my courses this term.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Huh? What?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought you were an 'A' student. How bad could your grades be?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Pretty bad, coach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/12.mp3"},{"answer":"The courses are getting harder.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/13.mp3"},{"answer":"My grades are pretty awful in Cost Accounting, and I'm failing outright in Economics.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm just not getting the work done that I need to do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I just don't have enough time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/16.mp3"},{"answer":"How'd you do in your midterms?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Not so good either.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/18.mp3"},{"answer":"62% on the Economics test,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/19.mp3"},{"answer":"73% in Cost Accounting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/20.mp3"},{"answer":"And 79% in Marketing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's supposed to be an easy course!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not going to graduate, with those kinds of scores.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got to get a lot more studying in before the finals, that's all there is to it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh. Um. So?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/25.mp3"},{"answer":"So... I'm not sure how much time I can give to football anymore.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I was wondering, wondering, uh...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/27.mp3"},{"answer":"how would it be if maybe I moved back to the B Squad, kind of 'in reserve', so to speak?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/28.mp3"},{"answer":"'In reserve'?! Cindy, you're the best forward we've got!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know, Coach, Marly's good too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/30.mp3"},{"answer":"She just needs a chance to show her stuff.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, but, she's not you, Cindy, and I, the team, we're counting on you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/32.mp3"},{"answer":"We've got to take on SFU first off next month,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/33.mp3"},{"answer":"and Marly's hardly played with the A Squad at all so far.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I just don't know whether there's time to break her in now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I can work with her during practice, Coach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/36.mp3"},{"answer":"She can do it, I know she can, and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Wait a minute, wait a minute, don't we have any other option?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/38.mp3"},{"answer":"What option is that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Well... how about a tutor?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, how about us finding you a tutor for those courses?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Somebody that, you know, could kind of give you what you need to pass your finals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Aw, Coach, I've gotta learn all this stuff myself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/43.mp3"},{"answer":"There's life after football, you know!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/44.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a lot of competition for jobs out there when I graduate, IF I graduate!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I know, Cindy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/46.mp3"},{"answer":"You're absolutely right!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I just don't want to lose you right before the tournament.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/48.mp3"},{"answer":"You've worked so hard to get this far, and so have all your teammates.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. That's why I feel so bad about this.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/50.mp3"},{"answer":"But I need this time to study, I really do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I know I'm just clutching at straws now, but how about this, then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/52.mp3"},{"answer":"I let you work Marly into your position in A Squad this week,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/53.mp3"},{"answer":"and then you take the next two weeks completely off from practice,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/54.mp3"},{"answer":"study hard, and, when's your first exam?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh... Economics is first. March 30th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/56.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, you take all the time off you need until then,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/57.mp3"},{"answer":"and if you pass that exam, come back for the first round of the tournament at least, OK?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/58.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the big one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/59.mp3"},{"answer":"If we can get past SFU, then confidence will carry us along from there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/60.mp3"},{"answer":"And we'll also have time to reassess your situation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Deal?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Can't make a deal yet, Coach, I just can't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me sleep on it, will you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me look at my schedule and try to figure this all out,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/65.mp3"},{"answer":"and then I'll get back to you. I promise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/66.mp3"},{"answer":"And think about that tutor, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/67.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll get you one of those too, if you think it will help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/68.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't want to jeopardize your career any more than you do,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/69.mp3"},{"answer":"and grades come first in my books, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks, really, I feel like you're taking real good care of me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, well, just take your time, you gotta do what you gotta do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/72.mp3"},{"answer":"But think it over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/73.mp3"},{"answer":"You're going to leave a big hole in the offense if you take off.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, I'll be in tomorrow afternoon for more of your torture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Right now I gotta take a shower and get out of here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Good. No partying tonight, you hear?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Got you, Coach. Good night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-9-2023-01-30-23-15-56/79.mp3"}]
